# profile: gemini
# @tier: 1
# @summary: Gemini through its OpenAI-compatible endpoint (Chat Completions). Embeddings from OpenAI.
# @key: the Gemini key in OPENAI_API_KEY (.env), plus EMBEDDING_API_KEY (an OpenAI key) for embeddings. The
#   Gemini key is never sent to OpenAI as long as EMBEDDING_API_KEY is set: the doctor warns if it is not.
# @cost: pay per token (Gemini has a free tier with rate limits); no prices ship for Gemini models, so cost is null
# @dotnet: yes (Chat Completions is what .NET always uses)
# @verified: STUB-TESTED ONLY (tests/test_gemini_compat_endpoint.py). No live call to Google. The model id is a
#   suggestion: check Google's current list.
# @evals: live quality and safety suites through the eval CLI, capability check; cost is unknown until a price is added
# @judge: not the model under test. Suggestion only, not calibrated (D-7, M3).
# @judge-env: JUDGE_PROVIDER=openai JUDGE_MODEL=gpt-5.1
LLM_PROVIDER=openai
LLM_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/
LLM_API=chat_completions
LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=openai
EMBEDDING_BASE_URL=
EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
EMBEDDING_DIM=1536
